  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Securing A Future for Tigers in southeastern WEFCOM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to, (1) develop a tiger specific Strategic Action Plan for southeast Western Forest Complex (sWEFCOM), (2) engage communities in tiger conservation by increasing awareness and assessing occurrence of human-tiger-conflict (HTC), (3) strengthen the capacity of management agencies to protect tigers, prey and habitat in sWEFCOM, and, (4) monitor the presence and distribution of tigers in sWEFCOM.</narrative>
  </description>
